 build le plus joué passe par Jambières du berzerker, Lame enragée de Guinsoo et Tremblelame navori (53,6 % de victoires). Moins courant, le build OFF-META Lame enragée de Guinsoo, Jambières gloutonnes et Ouragan de Runaan atteint 58,1 % sur 332 parties. Il s'en sort le mieux contre Hwei, Vayne et Syndra. Il souffre surtout contre Brand, Veigar et Twitch.","en":"On patch 16.21, Kog'Maw ADC has a 52.4% win rate over 12,585 ranked games (Emerald+), A tier. The most played build goes Berserker's Greaves, Guinsoo's Rageblade and Navori Flickerblade (53.6% win rate). Less common, the OFF-META build Guinsoo's Rageblade, Gluttonous Greaves and Runaan's Hurricane reaches 58.1% over 332 games. It does best against Hwei, Vayne and Syndra. It struggles most against Brand, Veigar and Twitch."}}